{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    " Install it there (%@), " : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : " そこにインストールする（%@）か、"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : " 請在該主機上安裝（%@），"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " Install it there, " : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : " そこにインストールするか、"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : " 請在該主機上安裝，"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " after the name scrolls to that line." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : " が名前の後にあると、その行までスクロールします。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : " 會捲動到該行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " and %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "と%@。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "和%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " delete-word, and your own chords or one-line text macros from CUSTOM SETUP, on every device." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : " で単語削除、そしてCUSTOM SETUPで作った自分のコードや1行のテキストマクロが、すべてのデバイスで使えます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : " 刪除單字，以及你自己在 CUSTOM SETUP 建立的組合鍵或單行文字巨集，在每部裝置上都能用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " in the press block right-clicks the remote for you — herdr's pane menu opens under your finger." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : " は長押しブロックからリモートを右クリックします — herdrのペインメニューが指の下に開きます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : " 在長按區塊中會替你對遠端執行右鍵點擊 — herdr 的窗格選單會在你手指下開啟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " key about half a second: taps stop summoning the keyboard. Hold again — or ⋯ → Unlock Keyboard — to release." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : " キーを約0.5秒長押しすると、タップしてもキーボードが出なくなります。もう一度長押しする — または ⋯ → Unlock Keyboard — で解除できます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : " 鍵約半秒：輕點就不會再叫出鍵盤。再按住一次 — 或用 ⋯ → Unlock Keyboard — 即可解除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " newline, a double " : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : " で改行、2回連続の "
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : " 換行、連按兩次 "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " opens a message box: write with autocorrect and your keyboard's own dictation, attach photos or files, then " : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : " はメッセージボックスを開きます。自動修正やキーボードの音声入力で書き、写真やファイルを添付して、"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : " 會開啟訊息框：用自動修正和鍵盤自己的聽寫撰寫、附加照片或檔案，然後 "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " opens it in the File Viewer. A " : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : " はファイルビューアで開きます。名前の後の "
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : " 會在檔案檢視器中開啟。名稱後面的 "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " sends it all as one message. The rail keeps driving the pane while you write; hold " : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : " ですべてを1つのメッセージとして送信します。書いている間もキーバーはペインを操作し続けます。長押しすると "
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : " 會把全部內容當成一則訊息送出。你在寫的時候，按鍵列仍可操作窗格；按住 "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " to type without submitting. Locking the keyboard closes it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : " で送信せずに入力できます。キーボードをロックすると閉じます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : " 就能輸入而不送出。鎖定鍵盤會關閉它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " — and %lld more." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : " — 他%lld件。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : " — 還有其他 %lld 項。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " — the remote's own pane menu." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : " — リモート自身のペインメニューです。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : " — 遠端自己的窗格選單。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"ALLOW PASTE\" EVERY TIME?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "毎回「ペーストを許可」と聞かれる？"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "每次都問「允許貼上」？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@" : {
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "%@ %lld, %@, current %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ %2$lld, %3$@, current %4$@"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ %lld、%@、現在の%@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ %lld，%@，目前的%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ IS A FOLDER" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@はフォルダです"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ 是資料夾"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ Unreachable" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@に接続できません"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ 無法連線"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ active" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@アクティブ"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ 使用中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ connected" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@接続済み"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ 已連線"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ didn't answer — check the port, and any firewall between this device and the host." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@から応答がありません — ポートと、このデバイスとホストの間のファイアウォールを確認してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ 沒有回應 — 請檢查連接埠，以及這部裝置與主機之間的防火牆。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ dropped the connection — the port may not speak SSH." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@が接続を切断しました — そのポートはSSHではない可能性があります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ 中斷了連線 — 該連接埠可能不是 SSH。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ finished" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@が完了しました"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ 已完成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ has a question" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@から質問があります"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ 有問題要問"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ identified itself with a %@ key, which isn't among the keys Multiplex recorded for it. Nothing was sent. If the server's host keys changed, forget the recorded keys in Host Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ identified itself with a %2$@ key, which isn't among the keys Multiplex recorded for it. Nothing was sent. If the server's host keys changed, forget the recorded keys in Host Settings."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@は%@鍵で自身を証明しましたが、Multiplexが記録している鍵に含まれていません。何も送信していません。サーバのホスト鍵が変わった場合は、ホスト設定で記録済みの鍵を削除してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ 以 %@ 金鑰表明身分，但那不在 Multiplex 為它記錄的金鑰之中。沒有送出任何資料。如果伺服器的主機金鑰變更了，請在主機設定中忘記已記錄的金鑰。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ identified itself with a %@ key, which isn't recorded for this host. Nothing was sent. If its host keys changed, forget the recorded keys under Host key and check again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ identified itself with a %2$@ key, which isn't recorded for this host. Nothing was sent. If its host keys changed, forget the recorded keys under Host key and check again."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@は%@鍵で自身を証明しましたが、このホストには記録がありません。何も送信していません。ホスト鍵が変わった場合は、「ホスト鍵」で記録済みの鍵を削除してもう一度確認してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ 以 %@ 金鑰表明身分，但這部主機沒有記錄該金鑰。沒有送出任何資料。如果主機金鑰變更了，請在「主機金鑰」中忘記已記錄的金鑰後再檢查一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ in session %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ in session %2$@"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@のセッション%@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ 的工作階段 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is %@ — the viewer opens %@ up to %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ is %2$@ — the viewer opens %3$@ up to %4$@."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@は%@です — ビューアが開ける%@の上限は%@です。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ 為 %@ — 檢視器可開啟的%@上限為 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is also running %@ under %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ is also running %2$@ under %3$@"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@は%@も%@で実行しています"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ 另外還有 %@ 在 %@ 上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is asking to bind" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@がバインドを要求しています"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ 要求綁定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is disabled and is not being connected" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@は無効なので接続しません"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ 已停用，不會連線"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is disabled. Enable" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@は無効です。有効にする"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ 已停用。啟用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is disabled. Enable it on the deck to open sessions on it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@は無効です。Deckで有効にすると、セッションを開けます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ 已停用。請在 Deck 上啟用它，才能在上面開啟工作階段。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is over 64 MB" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@は64 MBを超えています"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ 超過 64 MB"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is running %@ as well as %@. Showing both %@.\n\nNew sessions still start on %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ is running %2$@ as well as %3$@. Showing both %4$@.\n\nNew sessions still start on %5$@."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@は%@と%@の両方を実行しています。どちらの%@も表示します。\n\n新しいセッションは引き続き%@で作成されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ 同時執行 %@ 和 %@。兩者的%@都會顯示。\n\n新的工作階段仍會在 %@ 上建立。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ isn’t installed on %@, so there’s nothing to create the session with." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ isn’t installed on %2$@, so there’s nothing to create the session with."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@が%@にインストールされていないため、セッションを作成できません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ 沒有安裝在 %@ 上，因此無法用它建立工作階段。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ license text" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@のライセンス本文"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ 授權條款內容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ linking" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@接続中"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ 連線中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ links stay here" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@リンクはここから出ません"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ 連結不會離開這裡"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ models, one per line" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@のモデル、1行に1つ"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ 模型，每行一個"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ needs its SSH key passphrase" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@にはSSH鍵のパスフレーズが必要です"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ 需要 SSH 金鑰密語"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ needs its SSH key passphrase. Unlock" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@にはSSH鍵のパスフレーズが必要です。ロック解除"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "%@ 需要 SSH 金鑰密語。解鎖"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ of %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ of %2$@"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
