    "Binding never sends a private key: this device makes its own key and the machine adds the public half to authorized_keys. mpx unbind removes it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "バインドで秘密鍵が送信されることはありません：このデバイスが自分で鍵を作成し、マシンは公開鍵をauthorized_keysに追加します。mpx unbindで削除できます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "綁定絕不會傳送私鑰：這台裝置會自行產生金鑰，機器只把公鑰加進 authorized_keys。mpx unbind 可以移除它。"
